   "narrative": "After a Viet Minh regiment was caught in the open on 5 April, Giap gave up massed night charges and began digging. Trenches crept toward each strongpoint, cutting the French from their water and ammunition. On 10 April the French recaptured Eliane 1, and Huguette 6 was abandoned after a failed break-out on 18 April. Huguette 1 was overrun on 22 April, and with more than 90 percent of the airfield in Viet Minh hands the landing zone shrank to a few hundred metres, so parachute drops went astray.",
